{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":22.479999542236328,"text":"A stone corridor that was once full of water and ran right around the fortress. Today, you walk along the bottom of it, between walls ten meters high that saw no daylight for centuries. Look closely at the stones. Many carry scratched marks, the signs of the masons who cut them, because they were paid by the stone, and it had to be provable who had done what.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5799999833106995},{"word":"stone","start":0.5799999833106995,"end":0.8999999761581421},{"word":"corridor","start":0.8999999761581421,"end":1.2200000286102295},{"word":"that","start":1.2200000286102295,"end":1.659999966621399},{"word":"was","start":1.659999966621399,"end":1.840000033378601},{"word":"once","start":1.840000033378601,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"full","start":2.240000009536743,"end":2.4800000190734863},{"word":"of","start":2.4800000190734863,"end":3.0399999618530273},{"word":"water","start":3.0399999618530273,"end":3.0399999618530273},{"word":"and","start":3.0399999618530273,"end":3.5199999809265137},{"word":"ran","start":3.5199999809265137,"end":3.6600000858306885},{"word":"right","start":3.6600000858306885,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"around","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"the","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"fortress","start":4.619999885559082,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"Today","start":5.659999847412109,"end":5.920000076293945},{"word":"you","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.28000020980835},{"word":"walk","start":6.28000020980835,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"along","start":6.420000076293945,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"the","start":6.639999866485596,"end":7},{"word":"bottom","start":7,"end":7},{"word":"of","start":7,"end":7.28000020980835},{"word":"it","start":7.28000020980835,"end":7.5},{"word":"between","start":7.71999979019165,"end":7.960000038146973},{"word":"walls","start":7.960000038146973,